# cincaiAndroid Disclaimer

[⬅️ Kadazan Version](DISCLAIMER_KADAZAN.md)

---

### English Version

**NEVER forget that your phone can *cease to live* (ogundop).**
If you flash recklessly (*Blind Pigging*), beware — your phone may truly perish.

cincaiAndroid is 100% FREE to use.
But if you don’t know what you’re doing, your effort may end up wasted (*mogunsamang*).

---

⚠️ *Ogundop* = “cease to live / completely perish.”
⚠️ *Blind Pigging* = reckless flashing (local expression).
⚠️ *Mogunsamang* = wasted effort.
